OL,3,GNEWSAPuffin numbers down in survey
OL,4,Aafter tough winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FNumbers of puffins breeding on an
OL,7,Fisland fell this year as seabird
OL,8,Fspecies struggled with a difficult
OL,9,Fwinter, the National Trust has said.
OL,11,FThe Farne Islands, off the coast of
OL,12,FNorthumberland, is home to about
OL,13,F220,000 seabirds each summer and the
OL,14,Fannual survey showed a mixed picture,
OL,15,Fwith black-headed gulls, razorbills and
OL,16,Fgadwalls seeing increases.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
