OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1794464887
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPuffin numbers down in survey
OL,4,Aafter tough winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, European shags, Arctic
OL,7,Fterns, northern fulmars and common
OL,8,Fguillemots also saw breeding numbers
OL,9,Ffall in the wake of a hard winter in
OL,10,Fthe North Atlantic when three storms
OL,11,Fcontributed to a major seabird wreck.
OL,13,FConservationists warned the scale of
OL,14,Fthe event showed how vulnerable
OL,15,Fseabirds were to extreme weather caused
OL,16,Fby climate change.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
